# EchoBot Demo Website

This is the official demo and documentation website for EchoBot - an AI-powered chatbot widget that can be embedded into any website.

🌐 **Live at**: [https://demo.echobot.mohamedbgz.dev/](https://demo.echobot.mohamedbgz.dev/)

---

## 📋 About This Demo

This website showcases EchoBot's capabilities and serves as a live demonstration of the chatbot widget in action. Visitors can interact with the bot directly on the page to experience its features firsthand.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start for Visitors

1. Click the **"Try Demo"** button or the chat icon in the bottom-right corner
2. Upload a document (CSV, PDF, or DOCX) or use pre-loaded content
3. Ask questions about your content
4. Experience AI-powered responses in real-time

---

## 🛠 Technologies Used

- **HTML5** - Semantic markup structure
- **CSS3** - Custom styling with modern design
- **JavaScript** - Interactive widget functionality
- **EchoBot Widget** - Embedded chatbot integration

---

## 📂 File Structure
```
demo-website/
├── index.html              # Main landing page
├── css/
│   ├── styles.css         # Main website styles
│   └── widget.css         # Chatbot widget styles
├── js/
│   ├── openWidgetButton.js # Widget trigger functionality
│   └── widget.js          # Core widget script
├── icons/                 # SVG icons and images
├── videos/
│   └── hero-echoBot.mp4   # Hero section demo video
└── README.md              # This file
```

---

## 🎨 Customization

The demo website can be customized by editing:

- **styles.css** - Main website appearance, colors, layout
- **widget.css** - Chatbot widget position and size
- **index.html** - Content, sections, and structure

---

## 🔗 Integration on Your Website

To add EchoBot to your own website, include these two lines in your HTML:
```html
<script src="https://demo.echobot.mohamedbgz.dev/js/widget.js"></script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://demo.echobot.mohamedbgz.dev/css/widget.css">
```

For complete documentation and setup instructions, visit the [EchoBot GitHub repository](https://github.com/mohBgz/EchoBot).

---

## 📱 Responsive Design

The demo website is fully responsive and optimized for:
